  - m_Id: 20459982848
    m_Localized: If an enemy is hit with a different colored spell then deal extra
      damage equal to the amount of color the enemy holds. (Each time an enemy is
      hit with a spell their color increases). Max extra damage is {buff_0}.
    m_Metadata:
